
/opsx:propose We would like to build a phone app based on Anki for IPhones. The features we want: select any word/formula (e.g. mathematics/statistics)/code anywhere in your phone/browser and add it to your app with the right translation. It should be accessible also in the computer as soon as you add it to your app. The elements should be grouped by topic (e.g. grammar, themes) and build so-called decks. We should have a tracking tool to see the progress with 3 categories "New", "Learned", "Due". It should also have the ability to create automatically decks from any user's request for a specific topic (like "Create a deck with basic formulas describing OLS").
